{
  "description": "Internal retail fit-out at ground and basement levels, including the removal of a modern suspended ceiling to reveal the original historic coffered ceiling, breathable redecoration of ground floor classical columns, and exposure of circular basement columns. Reconfiguration of the modern (2017) internal staircase, including the installation of an independent, self-supporting rendered stud wall lining with integrated digital screens. Associated internal updates to non-structural partitions, flooring, and lighting utilizing existing containment. External works comprising non-abrasive shopfront cleaning, replacement of fascia lettering utilizing existing fixing holes, and installation of a new externally illuminated projecting sign and bronze bracket.",
